{{fbdoc item="title" value="Compiler Option: -title"}}----
Set the display title embedded in an original Xbox executable.

{{fbdoc item="syntax"}}##
	**-title** < //name// >
##
{{fbdoc item="param"}}
	##//name//##
		Title passed to the XBE conversion tool.

{{fbdoc item="desc"}}
	The ##-title## compiler option sets the display title stored in an XBE produced for the ##xbox## target.  If the option is omitted, the compiler uses the XBE output filename without its directory or extension.

	The title changes XBE metadata, not the output filename.  Use ##[[CompilerOptx|-x]]## to select the executable filename.  Supplying ##-title## for any target other than ##xbox## is an invalid compiler option.

{{fbdoc item="target"}}
	- Supported on the original Xbox target only.

{{fbdoc item="see"}}
	- ##[[DevBuildXbox|Compiling FB for Xbox]]##
	- ##[[CompilerOpttarget|-target]]##
	- ##[[CompilerOptx|-x]]##

